  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Terri Wesselman is an American entrepreneur who co-founded Omniplex World Services with Julien Patterson and served as its chief executive. The company provided security and background investigations for government and commercial clients. After selling a majority stake to Altamont Capital Partners, she stepped back from executive leadership and developed other businesses.",
